# WebdriverIO MCP

Use `wdio-mcp` when exploring the UI, verifying locators, or drafting tests.

- Session: Chrome, headed unless `HEADLESS=true`
- App: `https://sauce-demo.myshopify.com/`
- Prefer `get_elements` over screenshots
- Put locators and actions in page objects; keep Gherkin in `test/features`
- Close the session with `close_session` when finished
